    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nHooke & MacDonald are delighted to present this one-bedroom, fourth floor apartment to the market. This bright and spacious apartment is ideally located in the heart of the city centre, within the Cosgrave-built development Ivy Exchange.\n\nNo. 181 Ivy Exchange is a spacious one-bedroom fourth-floor apartment extending to approximately 63 sq.m / 678 sq.ft, ideally positioned within the highly regarded Cosgrave-built Ivy Exchange development in the heart of Dublin city centre. Enjoying a prime central location on Parnell Street, the property is just moments from Henry Street, O'Connell Street, Jervis Shopping Centre, and an extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants, and cultural amenities.\n\nIvy Exchange offers an enviable city-centre setting directly opposite the Ilac Shopping Centre, providing residents with unparalleled convenience and immediate access to all that Dublin city has to offer. The development is within walking distance of many of the capital's principal retail, business, and entertainment destinations, including Arnotts, Cineworld Cinema, Tesco, and the Jervis Centre. Excellent public transport services are available nearby, with both LUAS lines and numerous Dublin Bus routes easily accessible, ensuring seamless connectivity throughout the city and beyond.\n\nThe well-proportioned accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen with generous storage and preparation space, a large double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, a modern bathroom, and additional storage facilities. The apartment's generous floor area of approximately 63 sq.m provides comfortable and practical living space, making it an ideal choice for owner-occupiers and investors alike.\n\nOffering a combination of generous accommodation, a sought-after city-centre location, and excellent transport links, No. 181 Ivy Exchange represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a property in one of Dublin's most convenient residential developments."
      },
